{"results":[{"url":"https://www.statesmanjournal.com/story/news/wildfires/2026/07/31/ontario-oregon-man-charged-with-arson-for-brogan-canyon-fire/91116184007/","final_url":"https://www.statesmanjournal.com/story/news/wildfires/2026/07/31/ontario-oregon-man-charged-with-arson-for-brogan-canyon-fire/91116184007/?gnt-cfr=1&gca-cat=p&gca-uir=false&gca-epti=z113175e113175v000021&gca-ft=191&gca-ds=sophi&gnt-djm=1","title":"Ontario man charged with arson for Brogan Canyon Fire in eastern Oregon","description":"An Ontario man was charged with multiple counts of second-degree arson in connection to Brogan Canyon fires.","language":"en","text":"WILDFIRES\n\n# Ontario man charged with arson for Brogan Canyon Fire in eastern Oregon\n\nMakenzie Stamets\n\nSalem Statesman Journal\n\nJuly 31, 2026, 8:29 a.m. PT\n\nA 61-year-old Ontario man was charged with multiple counts of second-degree arson in connection to Brogan Canyon and Huntington Road fires on July 21, Malheur County Sheriff's Office said in a news release.\n\nThe man was arrested the night of July 21 and arraigned the next day on 15 counts of second-degree arson. His bail was set at $750,000 and he was being held at the Malheur County Jail.","author":"Makenzie Stamets","published_date":"2026-07-31T15:29:32Z","latency_ms":1333.1313209999962,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}